# env.optional — design
#
# GOOGLE_API_KEY is only an ALTERNATIVE to GEMINI_API_KEY, and only in one
# script (cover-image generation):
#
#   scripts/cip/generate.py:212  api_key = os.environ.get("GEMINI_API_KEY") or os.environ.get("GOOGLE_API_KEY")
#
# icon/generate.py and logo/generate.py never read GOOGLE_API_KEY — they require
# GEMINI_API_KEY specifically. So GEMINI_API_KEY is the required credential
# (see env.required) and GOOGLE_API_KEY is a bonus fallback for cip only → OPTIONAL.
GOOGLE_API_KEY
